# dotagent release signer (PUBLIC key only). The installer pins this key.
#
# Replace the line below with the public half of the YubiKey SSH key, i.e. the
# single line from `ssh-keygen -K` / ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_sk.pub:
#
#   sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com AAAA... release@susanb.dev
#
# Until a real key is committed here, packaging/repackage.py fails closed and
# no release (install.sh, wheels, npm, brew, deb/rpm/apk) can be produced.
